  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>In inductive circuit, the voltage leads the current by&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math>. Therefore,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>&#981;</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>V</mi></mrow></msub><mo>-</mo><msub><mi>&#981;</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>I</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>&#981;</mi><mrow><mn>0</mn><mi>V</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p>From the given equation&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>5</mn><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>49</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi>t</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>30</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math>, angular frequency&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#969;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>49</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>rad</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math></p><p>The amplitude of the voltage across the inductor will be,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><msub><mi>X</mi><mi>L</mi></msub></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>i</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mfenced><mrow><mi>&#969;</mi><mi>L</mi></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msub><mi>V</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mn>5</mn></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>49</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mn>30</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>23</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn></math>&nbsp;</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>23</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>1</mn><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mn>49</mn><mi>&#960;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>60</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></mrow></mfenced></math></p></blockquote>"
